{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cozy and lively island life! Here, your pets aren\u2019t just simple NPCs\u2014they have rich emotions, unique personalities, and memories. They\u2019ll actively play with you, and might even throw a little tantrum now and then!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to get the earliest updates and release notifications!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Companions to Soothe Your Heart!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build genuine, lasting friendships with your intriguing cats. Through everyday interactions\u2014chatting, playing, and feeding\u2014get to know each feline, raise your bond level, and enjoy a nurturing journey that\u2019s warm and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=752 height=726 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover New Species and Become a Fishing Master!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all kinds of fish to complete the full Fishdex\u2014from common  to rare species, all waiting in your net! Grip your rod; with patience and a bit of luck, you might even reel in a legendary creature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brick by Brick, Build Your Dream Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tons of customization options\u2014from your character to your pets, from interior d\u00e9cor to outdoor landscapes. From tranquil lakes to bustling harbors\u2026 craft your very own paradise, step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Online with Your Friends and Create Memorable Moments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer is supported. Invite friends to your island to fish together, swap raising tips, join party events\u2026 and create unique memories together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>WISHLIST NOW\u00a0</strong>\u2014we look forward to meeting you!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743680?t=1772438645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/760412d3d9562e75e787b0605cd45bc073d59374/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772438645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/f92f796a6cf325bfcddd908f530d0aa259df3a08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772438645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/f92f796a6cf325bfcddd908f530d0aa259df3a08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772438645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mewjito Studio</strong> is an indie game development team made up of creators passionate about exploring the intersection of AI and gaming. Our vision is to &quot;Build a living, breathing game universe.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We firmly believe that AI in games shouldn't just be a behind-the-scenes tool \u2014 it has the potential to bring more immersive, lifelike experiences to players. Think of the vivid NPCs in Westworld \u2014 living, breathing characters inside a virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game,\u00a0<strong><i>Circle Mountain Circle Sea,</i></strong>\u00a0is one branch of our journey down this path of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're experimenting with local AI deployment to reduce the cost for players and exploring how AI might inject new possibilities into already well-established gameplay systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're excited about the future of AI and gaming, or just curious about the other directions we're exploring, we warmly invite you to join and follow our community through the channels below. Come brainstorm with us and share your thoughts \u2014 your support is what keeps us going!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/1a5711b27e43c03fe87ea32c26088a05.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cozy and lively island life! Here, your pets aren\u2019t just simple NPCs\u2014they have rich emotions, unique personalities, and memories. They\u2019ll actively play with you, and might even throw a little tantrum now and then!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong> to get the earliest updates and release notifications!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Companions to Soothe Your Heart!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build genuine, lasting friendships with your intriguing cats. Through everyday interactions\u2014chatting, playing, and feeding\u2014get to know each feline, raise your bond level, and enjoy a nurturing journey that\u2019s warm and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=752 height=726 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/6ade22d1cba3527024903ebfd78deafa.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover New Species and Become a Fishing Master!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all kinds of fish to complete the full Fishdex\u2014from common  to rare species, all waiting in your net! Grip your rod; with patience and a bit of luck, you might even reel in a legendary creature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/5c9e6d5688f3010e042912641fc54c7b.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/943f393f4e5d9a34c285c2eddf27fdb0.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brick by Brick, Build Your Dream Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tons of customization options\u2014from your character to your pets, from interior d\u00e9cor to outdoor landscapes. From tranquil lakes to bustling harbors\u2026 craft your very own paradise, step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.poster.avif?t=1772438645\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.webm?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/9fca4c6b982f1c7f71d7cc93c63739fc.mp4?t=1772438645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Online with Your Friends and Create Memorable Moments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer is supported. Invite friends to your island to fish together, swap raising tips, join party events\u2026 and create unique memories together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>WISHLIST NOW\u00a0</strong>\u2014we look forward to meeting you!</h2>","developers":["Meowjito Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/3042b15f7b6d04bcc081a700997196b88bf09571/header.jpg?t=1772438645","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743680/1010414697/e8eff3658bdecaaf5b01982fc27b8b5ff8cd6e78/1760080471/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760081601","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto